    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 526 of the laws of 1998, amending the banking law relating to participation in the banking development districts program, in relation to extending the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7184",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7184-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
